    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: Hmm? You’re not\n",
        "collecting Kanto Gym Badges?\r",
        "The Gym Leaders in Kanto are as tough\n",
        "as any you battled in Johto.\f",
        "I recommend that you challenge them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: Ah, you’re collecting\n",
        "Kanto Gym Badges.\r",
        "I imagine that it’s hard, but the\n",
        "experience will surely help you.\r",
        "Come see me when you get them all.\n",
        "I’ll have a gift for you.\f",
        "Keep it up, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
