    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: Really?\n",
        "There is no need to be reserved..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "The Professor’s Pokémon Talk\n",
        "radio show is aired here and\f",
        "in Johto as well.\r",
        "Professor Oak is so...cool!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thanks to your work on\n",
        "the Pokédex, the Professor’s\f",
        "research is coming along well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0451_T01R0301_00035",
      "en_US": [
